  "releaseNotes": "Community edition, no key required: interactive REPL, --summary, --table, --type, --method, --il, --metadata, --filter, --find and --dependencies, across all 31 ECMA-335 metadata tables. Enterprise edition, using the same DEMEANOR_LICENSE key as Wise Owl Demeanor: --query natural-language metadata queries, --diff assembly comparison, --mcp Model Context Protocol server, and --json structured output. Coordinated version with Wise Owl Demeanor. Windows x64 and Linux x64; installing downloads only the platform you install on.",
